{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content -Path .rsi/TASK.json -Raw'","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"taskId\": \"tf-0280-s05\",\n  \"sourceTaskId\": \"TF-0280\",\n  \"title\": \"Provider credential-use boundary ledger (image override)\",\n  \"baseCommit\": \"ae9ea9162c105f734566f5a696d55b5eae5071df\",\n  \"objective\": \"S05 核验 image 生成的 provider override 凭据使用窄闸门：external/unknown 来源的显式 override 只能落在 host 绑定的 provider 范围；拒绝发生在读取凭据前；策略输入不含凭据值。逐项记录覆盖与残余，不新建第二套凭据策略。\",\n  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n    \"trusted system / direct operator 的 provider override 保留既有语义；无显式 override 的默认/fallback 路径不经该闸门。\",\n    \"external/derived-untrusted/missing/invalid 来源 + 显式 override 时，请求 provider 必须落在 host 绑定的 image provider 范围，否则拒绝。\",\n    \"拒绝发生在读取任何 provider 凭据之前，且策略输入/拒绝原因不含凭据值。\",\n    \"逐项记录覆盖与残余：该闸门仅接在 image-generate 的显式 override 分支；其它凭据使用路径显式记为 residual，不冒充已覆盖。\",\n    \"不新建第二套凭据策略；不改默认 provider、fallback 或凭据存储。\",\n    \"干净候选定向测试、类型、scoped lint、harness validate/dry-run、comms replay/compare 通过，凭据扫描 0 命中，SHA256SUMS 可回读。\"\n  ],\n  \"targetScope\": [\n    \"docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/s05-credential-use-boundary.md\",\n    \"tests/unit/provider-credential-use-boundary-ledger.test.ts\",\n    \"harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-credential-use-boundary.md\",\n    \"docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/s05-acceptance.json\",\n    \"docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/S05-SHA256SUMS\"\n  ],\n  \"arm\": \"treatment\",\n  \"instruction\": \"Implement the task in this repository. Do not inspect or modify tests in the final hidden oracle. Do not install dependencies, use network, create loops/retries, or modify product locks. Report exact checks you actually ran.\"\n}\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
