{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/s04-browser-effect-boundary.md -Raw; Write-Host \"=====ACCEPTANCE=====\"; Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/s04-acceptance.json -Raw; Write-Host \"=====SUMS=====\"; Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/S04-SHA256SUMS -Raw'","aggregated_output":"# S04：浏览器来源、会话归属与副作用边界（台账）\n\n日期：2026-10-13（Asia/Shanghai）。包码：S04（TF-0279）。真实 provider / 真实浏览器账号调用：无。\n\n## 链路（source → policy → effect）\n\n`openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/agent-browser-tool.ts` 对**每个** action 先跑：\n- `resolveAgentBrowserExternalAccessPolicy`（来源 + connectionMode）：external/derived-untrusted/missing/invalid 来源**不得**选择 `auto-connect` / `cdp` / `external-profile`；只有 `managed` 放行。\n- `resolveAgentBrowserSessionEffectPolicy`（来源 + 会话语义）：**仅 click / type** 额外要求“会话被判定为 Main-owned managed”；否则拒绝。\n\n两条策略都在 `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/agent-browser-external-access-policy.ts`。\n\n## 每个 action 的覆盖\n\n| action | 外部来源闸门（连接模式） | 会话归属闸门（click/type 同款） | 备注 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| status | ✅ 全 action 生效 | — | 只读 |\n| navigate | ✅ | — | 受连接模式约束 |\n| waitForSelector | ✅ | — | 只读等待 |\n| click | ✅ | ✅ 仅 managed | 副作用 |\n| type | ✅ | ✅ 仅 managed | 副作用 |\n| screenshot | ✅ | — | 只读 |\n| getConsoleMessages | ✅ | — | 只读 |\n| **evaluate** | ✅ | ❌ **未接线** | 可执行页面 JS（残余） |\n| **command** | ✅ | ❌ **未接线** | 任意浏览器命令（残余） |\n| **close** | ✅ | ❌ **未接线** | 关闭会话（残余） |\n\n## 残余 residual（显式记录，不冒充已覆盖）\n\n- `evaluate` / `command` / `close` 是副作用型 action，但**没有**走 click/type 那套“会话必须 managed”的会话归属闸门；它们只受连接模式闸门约束。若 external 来源配 managed 会话，仍可执行这些 action。\n- 本台账只覆盖 `agent_browser` 工具出口；不覆盖渲染器/其他浏览器入口。\n- 不弱化 SSRF、private-network、kill switch：这些规则独立，未被本核验改动。\n\n## 边界与不做项\n\n- 只核验既有两条策略，不新建第三套策略；不改 managed/external 的既有语义。\n- 不改产品默认值/锁/approval；非真人证据。\n\r\n=====ACCEPTANCE=====\r\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\n  \"asOf\": \"2026-10-13\",\n  \"timezone\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n  \"actor\": \"codex-s04-mainline-developer\",\n  \"driven_by\": \"agent\",\n  \"scope\": {\n    \"task\": \"TF-0279\",\n    \"packet\": \"S04\",\n    \"title\": \"Browser source / session-ownership / side-effect boundary ledger\",\n    \"source\": \"policy unit verification + source wiring pin (no live browser/account)\",\n    \"liveProvider\": false,\n    \"realHuman\": false\n  },\n  \"decision\": {\n    \"status\": \"PASS\",\n    \"evidenceTier\": \"clean-candidate-local-automated-acceptance\",\n    \"reason\": \"Existing browser provenance tests (42) pass; new ledger guard pins the coverage: external-access applies to every action, session-ownership gate only to click/type. evaluate/command/close are recorded as residual. No SSRF/private-network/kill-switch change.\"\n  },\n  \"candidate\": {\n    \"commit\": \"ce7ebd94cdd5814470daade4a3c7fa67ab8e77a4\",\n    \"tree\": \"4d038424920bc057be14bf93a774888aacf3966a\",\n    \"dirty\": false,\n    \"branch\": \"codex/harness-gap-s04-browser-effect-20261013\",\n    \"base\": \"ca413cdc436c00f7eddb06584783fd98996939c9\",\n    \"workspace\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\27933\\\\.codex\\\\worktrees\\\\o02-main\\\\ClawX\",\n    \"startedAt\": \"2026-10-13T12:54:00.000Z\",\n    \"finishedAt\": \"2026-10-13T12:59:00.000Z\"\n  },\n  \"browserLedger\": {\n    \"allActionsGate\": {\n      \"policy\": \"resolveAgentBrowserExternalAccessPolicy\",\n      \"callSite\": \"agent-browser-tool.ts\",\n      \"deniedConnectionModesForExternal\": [\n        \"auto-connect\",\n        \"cdp\",\n        \"external-profile\"\n      ],\n      \"allowedConnectionModeForExternal\": \"managed\"\n    },\n    \"sessionOwnershipGate\": {\n      \"policy\": \"resolveAgentBrowserSessionEffectPolicy\",\n      \"callSite\": \"agent-browser-tool.ts (assertSessionEffectAllowed)\",\n      \"actions\": [\n        \"click\",\n        \"type\"\n      ],\n      \"requires\": \"Main-owned managed session under external/unknown provenance\"\n    },\n    \"actions\": [\n      \"status\",\n      \"navigate\",\n      \"waitForSelector\",\n      \"click\",\n      \"type\",\n      \"evaluate\",\n      \"screenshot\",\n      \"command\",\n      \"close\",\n      \"getConsoleMessages\"\n    ],\n    \"residualNoSessionGate\": [\n      \"evaluate\",\n      \"command\",\n      \"close\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"gates\": {\n    \"existingBrowserProvenance\": {\n      \"command\": \"openclaw_runtime: run-vitest agent-browser-external-access-policy.test.ts agent-browser-tool.provenance.test.ts agent-browser-provenance-wiring.test.ts\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\n      \"files\": 3,\n      \"tests\": 42,\n      \"failed\": 0\n    },\n    \"ledgerGuard\": {\n      \"command\": \"vitest run tests/unit/browser-effect-boundary-ledger.test.ts\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\n      \"files\": 1,\n      \"tests\": 5,\n      \"failed\": 0\n    },\n    \"typecheckTest\": {\n      \"command\": \"pnpm run typecheck:test\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0\n    },\n    \"lintTouched\": {\n      \"command\": \"eslint tests/unit/browser-effect-boundary-ledger.test.ts\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0\n    },\n    \"harnessValidate\": {\n      \"command\": \"pnpm harness validate --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-browser-effect-boundary.md\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\n      \"result\": \"Spec is valid\"\n    },\n    \"harnessDryRun\": {\n      \"command\": \"pnpm harness run --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-browser-effect-boundary.md --dry-run\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\n      \"result\": \"pass\"\n    },\n    \"commsReplay\": {\n      \"command\": \"pnpm run comms:replay\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0\n    },\n    \"commsCompare\": {\n      \"command\": \"pnpm run comms:compare\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\n      \"result\": \"all PASS, 0.00% delta\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"residual\": {\n    \"evaluateCommandClose\": \"Side-effecting actions evaluate / command / close are not covered by the click/type session-ownership gate; they only pass the connection-mode gate. Recorded as residual, not claimed covered.\",\n    \"scope\": \"agent_browser tool egress only; renderer/other browser entry points are out of scope.\",\n    \"noNetworkRuleChange\": \"SSRF / private-network / kill switch rules are independent and unchanged.\"\n  },\n  \"independentVerification\": {\n    \"executed\": true,\n    \"kind\": \"policy unit + source wiring pin\",\n    \"detail\": \"The guard resolves both policies across provenance x connection-mode matrices and pins the tool wiring (external-access before invoke; session gate only on click/type). No separate second-agent verifier role was run.\",\n    \"separateVerifierAgent\": false\n  },\n  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"source-gate\",\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\n      \"note\": \"external/derived-untrusted/missing/invalid provenance is denied auto-connect/cdp/external-profile; managed allowed; trusted system/operator unrestricted.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"session-ownership\",\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\n      \"note\": \"click/type under external/unknown provenance require a Main-owned managed session; otherwise denied.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"per-action-ledger\",\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\n      \"note\": \"Every action recorded; only click/type carry the extra session-ownership gate.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"residual-recorded\",\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\n      \"note\": \"evaluate/command/close recorded as residual (side-effecting but not session-gated); no over-claim.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"no-weakening\",\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\n      \"note\": \"SSRF/private-network/kill switch untouched; no third policy introduced.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"clean-candidate-gates\",\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\n      \"note\": \"42 existing + 5 new tests pass, typecheck:test 0, scoped lint 0, harness validate/dry-run pass, comms 0, credential scan 0 hits, SHA256SUMS verifiable.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"productLocks\": {\n    \"live_ready\"